$comment GPiBridge rev A, firmware 0.4.2: GPIB at the RP2354A's bus pins, low = asserted $end
$timescale 10 ns $end
$var wire 1 ! DIO1 $end
$var wire 1 " DIO2 $end
$var wire 1 # DIO3 $end
$var wire 1 $ DIO4 $end
